      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 13,
      "truncated": false
    },
    {
      "source_uri": "file:///Users/scemac/My_github/Aegis/knowledge/techniques/cards/pwn-ret2dlresolve.md",
      "source_kind": "local_document",
      "verified": false,
      "action_policy": "none",
      "source_digest": "sha256:3edcc943850300f7c6982fe2019efaeddbcfcaf5cb18dd063918907ee566ee24",
      "compiler_version": "1.0.0",
      "kind": "list",
      "topic": "无 libc 泄漏：ret2dlresolve",
      "section": [
        "无 libc 泄漏：ret2dlresolve",
        "Do"
      ],
      "content": "1. 准备可写内存，构造 fake Elf_Rela/Elf_Sym/字符串，让动态链接器解析 system。\n2. 调用 PLT0 并传入 fake reloc 的 index；32 位通常比 64 位简单。\n3. pwntools 的 Ret2dlresolvePayload 可生成布局；核对对齐。\n4. 拿到 shell 或读出目标文件。",
      "line_start": 14,
      "line_end": 17,
      "truncated": false
    },
